            "text": "const e=\"Configure\",t=\"Settings\",o=\"Design\",n=\"Keymap\",r=\"Macros\",i=\"Lighting\",a=\"Config\",s=\"Basic\",c=\"Media\",l=\"Macro\",d=\"Layers\",g=\"Special\",u=\"Custom\",T=\"Fullscreen\",p=\"Keydown\",S=\"Keyup\",m=\"Chord\",h=\"Delay\",y=\"Save\",C=\"Load\",_=\"Magic\",E=\"Features\",I=\"Firmware\",D=\"Screen\",f=\"Connect\",L=\"Volume\",A=\"Transpose\",R=\"Reset\",b=\"Waveform\",P=\"Mode\",O=\"Definitions\",w=\"General\",N=\"Layer\",F=\"Clear\",B=\"Download\",k=\"Underglow\",K=\"Backlight\",v=\"Brightness\",G=\"Effect\",M=\"Color\",U=\"Click\",Y=\"Confirm\",H=\"Actuation\",x=\"Advanced Keys\",W=\"Actuation Point\",z=\"Dead Zone\",V=\"Switch\",Z=\"DKS\",Q=\"Rapid Trigger\",X=\"MPT\",q=\"MT\",J=\"END\",j=\"TGL\",$=\"SOCD\",ee=\"AT\",te=\"Revert\",oe=\"Deselect\",ne=\"sensitivity\",re=\"Add\",ie=\"Delete\",ae=\"Play\",se=\"Stop\",ce=\"FPS\",le=\"video\",de=\"Image\",ge=\"slider\",ue=\"File\",Te=\"Files\",pe=\"Processing\",Se=\"Type\",me=\"Cancel\",he=\"Interval\",ye=\"S\",Ce=\"None\",_e=\"Please DO NOT touch any keys during the calibration process.\",Ee=\"Wait\",Ie=\"Done\",De=\"Open\",fe=\"Flash\",Le=\"Update\",Ae=\"Layouts\",Re=\"Initializing\",be=\"Cancel transfer will revert to factory default {{res}}, confirm cancel?\",Pe=\"Yes\",Oe=\"No\",we=\"Theme\",Ne=\"Theme\",Fe=\"Copy\",Be=\"Share\",ke=\"Default\",Ke=\"Eager\",ve=\"Single Key Delay\",Ge=\"Single Row Delay\",Me=\"Single Key Trigger First\",Ue=\"Single Row Trigger First\",Ye=\"Asynchronous Single Key Trigger First\",He=\"Background\",xe=\"Foreground\",We=\"For firmware flash or media download to our keyboards, we highly recommend to directly insert the device into the computer's USB port. The use of extension cables, hub, and docking stations shall be avoided as they may lead to data transmission anomalies, which in turn could result in damage to the PCB chip.\",ze=\"It is not recommended to disable the dead zone to avoid mis-actuations.\",Ve=\"Test\",Ze=\"Language\",Qe=\"Looks like there was a problem getting USB detection working. Right now, we only support browsers that have WebHID enabled, so make sure yours is compatible before trying again.\",Xe=\"Indicator\",qe=\"Binding Key\",Je=\"Select key position from above\",je=\"Select trigger key from the right\",$e=\"Key\",et=\"Trigger Key\",tt=\"Hold\",ot=\"Tap\",nt=\"Hold trigger time\",rt=\"Release\",it=\"Press\",at=\"Trigger delay\",st=\"Trigger delay\",ct=\"Configure your Neo Sonic magnetic switch keyboard in a snap with NeoTuner. Tweak unique settings, save, close, and game on—no background app required.\",lt=\"Authorize the browser to connect to your device\",dt=\"In the dialog box that pops up below the URL bar, kindly select the keyboard you want to configure (as shown in the image below), and click the 'Connect' button to proceed with the setup.\",gt=\"Select your device from the list\",ut=\"Click 'Connect'\",Tt=\"Want to connect to HID device\",pt=\"Performance\",St=\"Settings\",mt=\"Neutral\",ht=\"Last input Priority\",yt=\"Absolute Priority (Key 1)\",Ct=\"Absolute Priority (Key 2)\",_t=\"Switch\",Et=\"Please click [Switch Calibration] in the upper right corner to calibrate.\",It=\"Notes\",Dt=\"Before starting calibration, please place the keyboard on a flat surface, such as stone countertops.\",ft=\"Do not move the keyboard during calibration.\",Lt=\"Do not touch any keys during auto calibration.\",At=\"For individual switch calibration, press and hold the switch multiple times to ensure accuracy.\",Rt=\"This switch is not calibrated yet.\",bt=\"This switch is abnormal.\",Pt=\"This switch is calibrated.\",Ot=\"Key travel detection\",wt=\"Completed\",Nt=\"Export the current configuration as a configuration file\",Ft=\"Import a configuration file to overwrite the current configuration\",Bt=\"key to bind\",kt=\"keys to bind\",Kt=\"Select\",vt=\"Reboot\",Gt=\"DFU\",Mt=\"Name\",Ut=\"Profile\",Yt=\"Export\",Ht=\"Import\",xt=\"Static\",Wt=\"Dynamic\",zt=\"Reactive\",Vt=\"Presets\",Zt=\"Custom Profile \",Qt=\"Continue\",Xt=\"Select {{n}} {{keys}} from the preview above to assign {{name}}\",qt=\"Binding\",Jt=\"Please select a macro button from the left to configure\",jt=\"Select the switch to replace\",$t=\"After replacing the switch, please recalibrate the replaced switch to avoid any discrepancies caused by differences between switches.\",eo=\"Note\",to=\"Please first select the key where the switch needs to be replaced.\",oo=\"After replacing the switch, please go to the calibration page and perform manual calibration for the replaced switches.\",no=\"Extreme Precision (\",ro=\"Rapid Trigger dynamically adjusts the actuation and reset points based on your key press/release intention, enabling instant triggering when pressed and instant release when lifted. This is highly beneficial for competitive games like FPS, fighting, and rhythm games.\",io=`When enabled, Rapid Trigger remains active within the set actuation range. \nWhen disabled, Rapid Trigger deactivates only after the key is fully released.`,ao=\"Profiles\",so=\"For first-time use of this product, please calibrate the keyboard keys to achieve optimal performance. Do not touch any keys during the calibration process.\",co=\"Important Notice: To enhance your keyboard experience, we recommend upgrading to the latest firmware. After completing the upgrade, please perform a calibration for optimal performance.\",lo=\"ChangeLog\",go=\"Updating\",uo=\"Do not disconnect the device during the upgrade process. If the connection is interrupted during writing, the device will remain in upgrade mode. You can recover by upgrading the firmware again.\",To=\"Update complete! Please recalibrate your keys!\",po=\"Calibrate\",So=\"Automatic calibration is complete\",mo=\"You may now perform manual calibration by fully pressing any designated key to better match your usage habits.\",ho=\"Please click the button below to copy the profile code for sharing\",yo=\"Please enter the profile code below to load